<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62235" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λειμών-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λειμών</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of a meadow</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κἀπὸ γῆς λ. δρόσοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					560
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνθεα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					374
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύλλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					18.39
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀράχναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					555b7
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεμώνη ἡ λ.</span>
			<i>Anemone pavonina, scarlet anemone</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				6.8.1
			</span></i> (= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἀγρία</span>, q.v.); also
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λειμωνία, ἡ</span>, a thorny plant, prob. 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκόλυμος</span>
			, <i>golden thistle, Scolymus hispanicus</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				6.4.3
			</span></i>. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λειμωνίᾳ</span> is corrupt in
				<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				601
			</span></i> (lyr.).)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
